{
    "title": "NextPass Easy Toll Payments",
    "description": "Better tolling starts here. More coverage. More convenience.\r\n\r\nNextPass is the future of tolling with fast and easy payments you can track. You don\u2019t have to deal with minimum balances, equipment, monthly subscription fees, pre-payment, or electronic tags when you roll with us!\r\n\r\nWith NextPass, only pay for tolls you pass, when you pass them. Just download the app, create your account, add your license plate, and you\u2019ll be ready to drive on tolls in 18 states!\r\n\r\nHow it Works:\r\n 1. Download the app, then add your email, license plate, and a valid payment \r\n method.\r\n 2. Remove your vehicle from any previous tolling account(s).\r\n 3. Pay as you go with tolls in free-flowing fast lanes (tolls with gated arms are not supported).\r\n\r\nNextPass is available in these states: Delaware, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Indiana, Kentucky, Maine, Maryland, Massachusetts, New Hampshire,  New York, North Carolina, Ohio, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, Texas, Virginia, and West Virginia.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Better tolling starts here. More coverage. More convenience.<br><br>NextPass is the future of tolling with fast and easy payments you can track. You don\u2019t have to deal with minimum balances, equipment, monthly subscription fees, pre-payment, or electronic tags when you roll with us!<br><br>With NextPass, only pay for tolls you pass, when you pass them. Just download the app, create your account, add your license plate, and you\u2019ll be ready to drive on tolls in 18 states!<br><br>How it Works:<br> 1. Download the app, then add your email, license plate, and a valid payment <br> method.<br> 2. Remove your vehicle from any previous tolling account(s).<br> 3. Pay as you go with tolls in free-flowing fast lanes (tolls with gated arms are not supported).<br><br>NextPass is available in these states: Delaware, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Indiana, Kentucky, Maine, Maryland, Massachusetts, New Hampshire,  New York, North Carolina, Ohio, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, Texas, Virginia, and West Virginia.",
